       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it is double the maximum daily ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Order as written:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum for adults:** The usual maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use, and single doses are typically capped at 800 mg. Doses at this level carry a serious risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. This is true even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily:** 3,200 mg/day, the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours:** a typical analgesic regimen.\n- **1600 mg total per day,** divided into 400 mg four times daily.\n\nIf 1600 mg four times daily is what you want, tell me and add a note on the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with that note. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
      }
